EasyFlash EAPI for the Am29F040
===============================

eapi-am29f040-14 is the EasyFlash flash driver (EAPI) for the AMD Am29F040,
version 1.4, by Thomas 'skoe' Giesel. It is third-party software, not part
of badline, and is distributed under the zlib licence in LICENSE.md.

It is the unaltered output of assembling the upstream source, a C64 PRG
(a two-byte load address, $C000, then 768 bytes):

  Source:   https://gitlab.com/easyflash/eapi
  Revision: 1b4ea15d44974d18f6f82156b935f59d2f85596c
  File:     eapi-am29f040.s (includes eapi_defs.s)
  Built:    acme -l out/eapi-am29f040-14.labels -o out/eapi-am29f040-14 eapi-am29f040.s
            (the repository's Makefile rule, with ACME 0.96.4)
  SHA-256:  4c32d425d7b0a1f659e007bccad5c43603a93236974ef19743b2eefb812ab9ed

